&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product Marketing early so go-to-market strategy helps shape the product, not just the launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product management experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in product management owning a distinct product area, ideally focused on developer platforms, PaaS, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of building, deploying, and running applications in the cloud, with the ability to collaborate closely with infrastructure engineers on multi-tenant architectures or distributed systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software development background:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with building software using languages such as Python, Ruby, JavaScript, PHP, Go, or Rust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
